Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 03:13:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf(picker): whole-payload memo for
 build_model_options_payload keyed on config/.env/auth/env/plugin/usage stamps

Warm model.options ~28 ms (worker-5) -> 0.8 ms on a memo hit. Stamp parts are named in
inventory._STAMP_PARTS; each has an invalidation test and a pin-the-part mutant test. refresh=True
bypasses and clears; entries expire after 5 s so un-stamped inputs (cooldown expiry, pricing, live
probes) and warmer side effects re-arm.
